I understand and support the SC''s decision. But I wanted to add a personal note of congratulations for a stellar image. Pun intended. This is first-rate astrophotography, and as one who is more often than not bored by such images (I know, I know...), I hope that registers as a huge compliment. :-D</td>', 'I understand and support the SC''s decision. But I wanted to add a personal note of congratulations for a stellar image. Pun intended. This is first-rate astrophotography, and as one who is more often than not bored by such images (I know, I know...), I hope that registers as a huge compliment. :-D', '2026-01-25 21:25:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7808319, 1303415, 58667, '<td valign="top">
